---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Swiss Modernist · preview</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --sw-bg: #FFFFFF;
      --sw-bg-alt: #F5F5F2;
      --sw-ink: #0A0A0A;
      --sw-muted: #5A5A5A;
      --sw-violet: #2D2F8F;
      --sw-violet-dark: #1F2070;
      --sw-vermillion: #E63946;
      --sw-line: #0A0A0A;
      --sw-hair: #E0E0E0;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--sw-bg);
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      line-height: 1.55;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .sw-display { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    /* NAVBAR — hard rectangle, thick rule below */
    .sw-nav {
      padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sw-line);
    }
    .sw-nav-brand {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .sw-nav-brand::before {
      content: "■ ";
      color: var(--sw-vermillion);
    }
    .sw-nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
    .sw-nav a {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .sw-nav a:hover { color: var(--sw-vermillion); }
    .sw-nav .sw-lang { letter-spacing: 0.12em; }

    /* HERO — massive geometric sans, full bleed */
    .sw-hero {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 5rem 2rem 6rem;
    }
    .sw-kicker {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sw-vermillion);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }
    .sw-kicker::before {
      content: "";
      width: 36px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--sw-vermillion);
    }
    .sw-hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      max-width: 14ch;
      color: var(--sw-ink);
    }
    .sw-hero h1 .sw-vm {
      color: var(--sw-vermillion);
    }
    .sw-hero p {
      font-size: 1.1875rem;
      color: var(--sw-muted);
      max-width: 58ch;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .sw-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
    .sw-btn {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 0;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: background .15s, color .15s, border-color .15s;
    }
    .sw-btn-primary { background: var(--sw-violet); color: #fff; }
    .sw-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--sw-violet-dark); }
    .sw-btn-quiet {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      border-color: var(--sw-ink);
    }
    .sw-btn-quiet:hover { background: var(--sw-ink); color: #fff; }

    /* SECTION */
    .sw-section {
      border-top: 2px solid var(--sw-line);
      padding: 5rem 2rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .sw-section-label {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }
    .sw-section-label::after {
      content: "▌";
      color: var(--sw-vermillion);
    }
    .sw-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--sw-hair);
    }
    .sw-cell {
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sw-hair);
    }
    .sw-cell:nth-child(odd) {
      padding-right: 3rem;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--sw-hair);
    }
    .sw-cell:nth-child(even) { padding-left: 3rem; }
    .sw-cell-num {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--sw-vermillion);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .sw-cell h3 {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.875rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
    }
    .sw-cell p { color: var(--sw-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; max-width: 42ch; }

    /* FEATURED — violet/white split, hard angles */
    .sw-featured-wrap {
      background: var(--sw-violet);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
    }
    .sw-featured {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .sw-featured .sw-kicker {
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .sw-featured .sw-kicker::before { background: var(--sw-vermillion); }
    .sw-featured h2 {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .sw-featured h2 .sw-vm-alt { color: var(--sw-vermillion); }
    .sw-featured p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      max-width: 50ch;
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .sw-featured .sw-btn-primary {
      background: var(--sw-vermillion);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .sw-featured .sw-btn-primary:hover { background: #c92e3b; }
    .sw-stat-card {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--sw-vermillion);
    }
    .sw-stat-card .sw-stat-num {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 0.9;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      color: var(--sw-violet);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .sw-stat-card .sw-stat-label {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sw-muted);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .sw-stat-card hr {
      border: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--sw-hair);
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }
    .sw-stat-card p {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: var(--sw-muted);
    }
    .sw-stat-card strong {
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    .sw-footer {
      border-top: 2px solid var(--sw-line);
      padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--sw-muted);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .sw-footer a {
      color: var(--sw-ink);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .sw-footer a:hover { color: var(--sw-vermillion); }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .sw-grid, .sw-featured { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
      .sw-cell:nth-child(odd), .sw-cell:nth-child(even) {
        padding: 2rem 0;
        border-right: 0;
      }
      .sw-hero { padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="sw-nav">
    <div class="sw-nav-brand sw-display">AI Safety Colombia</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#">Sobre</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Programas</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Hackathon</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Eventos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Recursos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#" class="sw-lang">ES · EN</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <section class="sw-hero">
    <div class="sw-kicker">Investigación · Comunidad · Política</div>
    <h1 class="sw-display">Seguridad de IA <span class="sw-vm">desde</span> Colombia.</h1>
    <p>Investigación, comunidad y política pública para que la IA avance de forma segura en América Latina. Una comunidad de investigadores, ingenieros y profesionales de política trabajando juntos.</p>
    <div class="sw-actions">
      <a class="sw-btn sw-btn-primary" href="#">Únete a la comunidad</a>
      <a class="sw-btn sw-btn-quiet" href="#">Ver recursos</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sw-section">
    <div class="sw-section-label">Qué hacemos</div>
    <div class="sw-grid">
      <div class="sw-cell">
        <div class="sw-cell-num">R / 01</div>
        <h3>Investigación</h3>
        <p>Evaluaciones, alineación y gobernanza con la comunidad técnica latinoamericana. Trabajamos en problemas abiertos.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sw-cell">
        <div class="sw-cell-num">C / 02</div>
        <h3>Comunidad</h3>
        <p>Investigadores, ingenieros y profesionales de política en Bogotá y en línea. Grupos de discusión y hackathons.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sw-cell">
        <div class="sw-cell-num">F / 03</div>
        <h3>Formación</h3>
        <p>Cursos curados de BlueDot Impact y rutas de aprendizaje para distintos puntos de partida.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sw-cell">
        <div class="sw-cell-num">G / 04</div>
        <h3>Gobernanza</h3>
        <p>Política pública sobre IA en Colombia y América Latina. Documentos, conversaciones y aportes regulatorios.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="sw-featured-wrap">
    <div class="sw-featured">
      <div>
        <div class="sw-kicker">Hackathon · 19–21 Jun 2026</div>
        <h2 class="sw-display">Global South AI Safety <span class="sw-vm-alt">Hackathon</span></h2>
        <p>Un fin de semana donde investigadores, ingenieros y profesionales de política de América Latina, África y Asia construyen seguridad de IA para sus regiones. Organiza Apart Research; AI Safety Colombia coordina el hub de Bogotá.</p>
        <a class="sw-btn sw-btn-primary" href="#">Inscríbete</a>
      </div>
      <div class="sw-stat-card">
        <div class="sw-stat-num">USD<br/>1.000</div>
        <div class="sw-stat-label">Premio por equipo regional</div>
        <hr/>
        <p><strong>Tres días</strong> · <strong>Cuatro pistas</strong> · evals, gobernanza, interpretabilidad, LAWS. Hubs simultáneos en Bogotá, Buenos Aires y México DF.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="sw-footer">
    <div>© 2026 AI Safety Colombia · Bogotá</div>
    <div>
      <a href="#">WhatsApp</a> · <a href="#">Instagram</a> · <a href="#">LinkedIn</a> · <a href="#">Contacto</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
